# Puppetmaster Blues (battlefield.puppetmaster_blues#reqs, Talacca Cove): All four chars are refused; each gets
# NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY 7376 (the framework's trigger), then the entry NPC's default 32767 (DefaultActions.lua): main
# accepted with the switch only, bob accepted with the chip only, cat available with both key items, dan accepted with
# neither.
lists TalaccaCove/_1l0/onTrigger
char zone=TalaccaCove pos=-100,-9.399,-85 job=PUP lvl=75
char bob zone=TalaccaCove pos=-100,-9.399,-85 job=PUP lvl=75
char cat zone=TalaccaCove pos=-100,-9.399,-85 job=PUP lvl=75
char dan zone=TalaccaCove pos=-100,-9.399,-85 job=PUP lvl=75
quest AhtUrhgan.PuppetmasterBlues accepted
keyitem ToggleSwitch
bob: quest AhtUrhgan.PuppetmasterBlues accepted
bob: keyitem ValkengsMemoryChip
cat: keyitem ToggleSwitch
cat: keyitem ValkengsMemoryChip
dan: quest AhtUrhgan.PuppetmasterBlues accepted
login
bob: login
cat: login
dan: login
trigger _1l0
bob: trigger _1l0
cat: trigger _1l0
dan: trigger _1l0
